{"total_count":1264,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/6193884bddfc1cc0a05ddb151f3154f4bceb6a8e","sha":"6193884bddfc1cc0a05ddb151f3154f4bceb6a8e","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NjU2MDA5NzU6NjE5Mzg4NGJkZGZjMWNjMGEwNWRkYjE1MWYzMTU0ZjRiY2ViNmE4ZQ==","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/commit/6193884bddfc1cc0a05ddb151f3154f4bceb6a8e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/6193884bddfc1cc0a05ddb151f3154f4bceb6a8e/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/commits/6193884bddfc1cc0a05ddb151f3154f4bceb6a8e","author":{"date":"2026-02-26T16:25:37.000Z","name":"Malay Bag","email":"malaybag@meta.com"},"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T16:25:37.000Z","name":"PyTorch MergeBot","email":"pytorchmergebot@users.noreply.github.com"},"message":"[PyTorch] Refactor FakeTensor device normalization into property (#175669)\n\nSummary:\nRefactored device normalization logic in FakeTensor by:\n1. Extracting normalization logic into a reusable _normalize_fake_device() method\n2. Converting fake_device to a property with automatic normalization on assignment\n3. Adding comprehensive unit tests for the property behavior\n\nThis improves code organization, encapsulation, and makes device normalization\nconsistent across all assignment paths.\n\nWith this change, all fake device assignment with cuda device will have default device index 0\n\nTest Plan:\n- Added test_fake_device_property_normalization to validate:\n  - CPU device (no normalization)\n  - CUDA device with explicit index (preserved)\n  - MPS device without index (normalized to mps:0)\n  - Property setter normalization for both MPS and CUDA devices\n- All existing tests pass\n- Lint checks pass\n\nDifferential Revision: D94259984\n\nPull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/175669\nApproved by: https://github.com/aorenste, https://github.com/ezyang","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repo